          "architecture_status": "The 6-stage RPM sequence (1000..6000, 3 min per stage, autostop after 3 min at 6000 RPM) runs entirely in the Arduino firmware. PyLabView Studio is a passive event listener: spinning_drop_stage_watcher appends one table row per firmware stage-completion event (5x TARGET_RPM + 1x ACK:AUTOSTOP_6000) and never times anything itself.",
